The Company’s 2008 Stock incentive Plan can authorize up to 10,000,000 common shares, which can be granted as RSU’s, unrestricted shares, incentive stock

options, nonqualified stock options, PSU's or SAR’s. Awards under this plan generally expire seven or ten years from the date of grant, thirty days after termination of
